### Summary of how this flows now:
 * **Manual Post:** Maker submits -> Status S. Maker immediately clicks "Execute" -> Status flips to P instantly.
 * **Small Excel Post:** Maker uploads -> Async finishes in 2 seconds. Maker clicks "Execute" at 10 seconds -> Status flips to P instantly.
 * **Massive 50,000 Excel Post:** Maker uploads -> Async takes 2 minutes. Maker clicks "Execute" at 10 seconds -> Status stays S. At 2 minutes, Async thread finishes and flips it to P.
No checkers will ever see broken data, and the Maker is never rushed by a timer again!
